{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1551,
  "batch_count": 1662,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "c0513553da490a692523f45b5f779f99f6cb7e34",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63c87824efb41f1dd8c708ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "——我看见了。冲线的瞬间…\n大家发出欢呼，心意合而为一的\n身影——…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4532be5df2a560f09af6b4b784f2bc7fef23c4ad9a275b2064d58ae7ad859172",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8883af6ba6373167ef6a79f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来的路上，熟识的小猫\n给了我鼓励的话。\n它说『比赛要加油哦』…呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d9cac190f9848466d92271ca137d9a199a12de5cd5ba485e8648f8dea27a708",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33dda319d0357dd6ea9cd2bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态和平时没有区别。所以今天\n也请你好好看着。看着与你一同编织的日子所结出的成果——",
      "source_fingerprint": "1de7e611ccad5e0741c1c730a65448088338c0df057d8f67065df0f996779d67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3249dfdd148163a52f42154b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欢呼声…已经传到这里了呢。\n把胸中回响的心意化作力量，\n——希望之环，我会继续连结下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8db49258a1a2c762b1bce3f860513b16a0200eb0b4d5cf4b5d28142932cad8c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b238b580919c7649de3688d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会握着绿松石祈祷。\n愿出赛的大家，\n都能平安地跑完全程…",
      "source_fingerprint": "84875fda70aed74ce572d5e3164bdcffe7352fcec3253b25f14c4f329e5543a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccd20ba65c2b18514b01d640",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吸——…呼——…。\n…愿至今积累起来的一切，\n能够连结到未来…",
      "source_fingerprint": "80e7c2e617db572a82b2c8b99aa5fe66409ecd2528e64adc723d20bfcc215327",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e88300e905909abd4097d5e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不要着急，先放松身体\n再出发吧。今天也一定\n能跑出好表现的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e7fda8b66a280d8cbfe1fd39923c5cd5c3a0c615408d7459836a8ff3a1d76b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27fbc3c0f7b89b5832f056d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正因为是在出赛前，才更要微笑呢。\n若要在心中点亮光芒，首先，\n我们自己就必须成为那道光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e50990c81ef8e5ba9803b39c471ef3997a56579f8c27f8a66e4608930daaa4e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0bb9c0e3710c762d1576861",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…没事的…。凭这次奔跑…\n一定能把希望…编织出来…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f7a784dd92e075e69836788a0ac8b015557ca1118c482194f6c4b35d6575081",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2567f1d3ee064d6c267ac047",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…呼。\n肩膀深处还稍微有些僵硬呢。\n…再稍微慢慢转动一下…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05c6f82b256d966e9aad7e8c8688246138e5d0e639f81e0f8c2244e49d59fbcf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0062372599350003d6a1bc4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽说还称不上万全…但希望\n始终就在我们身边。\n请不要担心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "477df0016064a29eeb6d6765300a4b31e653d01acbcd064782fde8b3c7ac227c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c23c96f31e1b14b2acde4201",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拜托了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69dce43a1e83db8317414d94819a56690e2f8869762928420aca26a49bd4a3fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d10d75121e90ba1e030899b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5340d32cafefeb07fb71f273be0d9e41c17a0c3f97ce3ec0784aa70ad39fd299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f9a9384d53748c17e62915c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5af41dba62d130b44655e117242c6fb57d53e5d0bb265cfc362d0f9488cac6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9342f914c2966c28e1477da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "集中…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dd0b816c66daf32a658d5954190b89da51361bfe863198fcba39354583245d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:473898842aefb4ea35859110",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么会…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "406fcad51e4f61af30c23ee8e701c6d35fc07ed87dbb3ec812c403d8729568e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d6b63471635f9316a7bbbc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d1781fc5f3f2aabe9eb0ac8829be6b9368cb1ffaf566104e3a77272c2aafbd5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f99ca41e9e57187603de983",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0f0665e0a69c08888c3252e4588492414e62eb2a101e0b2a5a81f3189d824bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb2e1c96fdec8f1b2b885472",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好舒服的风…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4a81f129ec7b2f3f75c94f3c3c9ac724be2be415c422afbfddba8b17b710ef6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:725741afe3175a83c28d8726",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多亏了你，我才能把希望连结起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb1c1ff01aa17ad4bdea6f4bb08e741cda086184dd61a8f83b19968720f56501",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff90201bc8dbd2358beff952",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢你一路陪我到这里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "956dbc965ec54cd13dacf14188d66c097f88e1204232e03b777fa387769a10f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f60497854ee14f7001bd75a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们将心连在一起吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "891e42aed401f8ceacf6420ea1aa0882c67c9257ca14ee2c2683d89555f83eaf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c3d2cef1a88dd8360b0d2d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起努力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3382cddefb3b5851054894026cb53f29316b7430069927058d0134d0bb83b496",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1641929ad758c3e8b9083c42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们一同连结吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8383376008e49813ed0e63f72d4ea4e7119fbe1ed14941a5419a2d7e67601e8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:154f5bb96bbcd942955e35c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢你一路陪我到这里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "956dbc965ec54cd13dacf14188d66c097f88e1204232e03b777fa387769a10f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a6fd9e844d545c5d5a0f318",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来的路上，熟识的小猫\n给了我鼓励的话。\n它说『比赛要加油哦』…呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d9cac190f9848466d92271ca137d9a199a12de5cd5ba485e8648f8dea27a708",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4240ae33c17d4119e7a0a6ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体非常轻盈。\n与你共同积累的日子，如今仿佛\n化作了编织希望的羽翼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b747cd092c0e8add3632afbfa5ad4c5ef5945b5390c50993075cce1d6e389a5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81d20385e1340472fe02aae7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢你一路陪我到这里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "956dbc965ec54cd13dacf14188d66c097f88e1204232e03b777fa387769a10f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f750aeb22d2932b0a49560b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5340d32cafefeb07fb71f273be0d9e41c17a0c3f97ce3ec0784aa70ad39fd299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43384d1b1b39ce9e4bd9f98b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要跑出更多点亮希望的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60dad709f151e19050f47024c7ce25bd2ff1a36e38234c0a74d05d20569a72fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79b0c9b07793b6920f5f813b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望之环，应该还能继续扩大…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77a7e9c0698e569b57cff2c9613cfb5b2f333ada2dbf35fbb6ba664d0c970d85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1d3cb429060a576110b3f52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必须从这里，连结到下一次…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41091496d15570a6b76d866defa9923448faa9de6528c91b7a80635d6568c57d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a502d37e0d7b7782ff17eb9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论何时，光芒都一定存在…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ec701934cc0293a2ffe9c9601ee61a6e9127cf3897530f33db474299411b812",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e6b9bc5c5791b0501dce26c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿这次奔跑，能照亮某个人的心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "435f1564143ef2cbe15d174cb990362eb5e8c644ced9aac9a3f51a69a0263f57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:669ff82627d9c7cc1caff54d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿希望——已经传达到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6ee1ab8ff4d52b157b8ca9b43fa3ec3b0977c6bd31b4e46a0f0bc0bb9dfab11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f346e3c2d60f7aff2f199e90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91819126087ccfa80daa4140",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将希望的巨大『圆环』——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d3bf03e7e9d9b64d784bc1ca18595aa270ed51b75b5d818601efdeea11bd8e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:310493ed6d9425925757d710",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望无论何时，都在你的身边。\n来吧，让我们连结起来。将希望的巨大『圆环』——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f009f85e25909498c63ac3998417abd7f8cde4a02152fc5bc0c339891ef18fb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab3f6b84a9b6320c80ca4b5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会用歌声与舞蹈，连结希望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "066f4e6f36f92df4c95d6e365060cc918d71c577526e845ce704c9ec6d4f76ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cca3b930cebc4fc6fd563f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在最棒的舞台上，让心合而为一。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c739ab707c06f1a59332c33c35be443b7362364f7105795f1069c654dcd057e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fe360edcea1b142b64f42e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不可以一个人独自硬撑哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e43c308286059fccfa5aa9e1cb23bcf82e108590f2703a0eb9409cf1ba6b6ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7244727e0c59c079e9b1e37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那一天，我的心中点起了光。\n只要和你一起，就能将希望\n赠予更多人——那是让我如此相信的光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04aa0725a757f2d9093143cf4791e97b65e63e5c664561b86e217c78b76e6819",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c78ede2ef42b4588485f971",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "若要陪伴在某人身旁，清爽整洁是很重要的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9127b4bc7beea3b86ce1a924d9399fd6ab5a1ad9867b3ce727b8c4ffff99279c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b39dd43780435436688ad85f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着成对的衣服，感觉连心也连在一起了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e86b90ca3b5a3bd2f7f9127172e4d5cae7c062184600d8dc188881e51f38f10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40c00e72131bb89a0a112bcd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会让任何人孤身一人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5229286bc58648cc5f7d8508ca6e1d827d75b433f60b3add4222495c5cd7c0de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7278792c3bbc3fa40448cdc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下一节数学，会出什么样的题目呢…呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b31344181cc833bb556c1c54b9cabc704f0008bd039a336203b4e450ac0c2e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4f16726ddfb191c0d47e7b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论怎样的舞台，我都会让它扩展开来。一定会扩展出笑容之环。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdf5538795b3d2abb183693d905fd7e1b67d891c0f0578eb3e361492a9b2c9a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45a1b8eda6a4763cd872349c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这条缎带，像羽翼一样，很漂亮呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "871b20fd902e369b950f2e3ff98021206151bf967d0d2e1a15b6fa9ab4c539d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5594c9ebf41b6c5ec016f545",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，穿起来真舒服…♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f6294c88f88c299aba896303edce33f449a166bbb44e7313deb0c1e62b63a03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35ca870ab20a277f68d4f449",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着改变了，心情也会不同呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd80642689c9190857edcdb8d4f84d36a6b7a69b82cdc0dc02a6f0c507724127",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba388a7fff5af3ea75ec0d16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要去哪里出门呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "49aea722f60057ce0e23f04f3e1988eb0edc1a25efae7a9cb8427095701923d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0da33e3f2a4e0c5a66c93c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这枚胸针，是父亲送给我的礼物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3d11d6570b702be2e27ae25ad2ad2a9367f2f0f903ffe5a0ddb2f0fa135b964",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c70e2f3cd3ff1d26be2c8bc0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "若要陪伴在某人身旁，清爽整洁是很重要的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9127b4bc7beea3b86ce1a924d9399fd6ab5a1ad9867b3ce727b8c4ffff99279c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f447f28eb7a3eca285ddc67f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着成对的衣服，感觉连心也连在一起了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e86b90ca3b5a3bd2f7f9127172e4d5cae7c062184600d8dc188881e51f38f10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70e196a3502c7715851e27ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会让任何人孤身一人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5229286bc58648cc5f7d8508ca6e1d827d75b433f60b3add4222495c5cd7c0de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40dbb89ebb5f66ff292579ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下一节数学，会出什么样的题目呢…呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b31344181cc833bb556c1c54b9cabc704f0008bd039a336203b4e450ac0c2e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d1fe1252956f68174665656",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论怎样的舞台，我都会让它扩展开来。一定会扩展出笑容之环。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdf5538795b3d2abb183693d905fd7e1b67d891c0f0578eb3e361492a9b2c9a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad7eeaff093c7c6d834d89d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这条缎带，像羽翼一样，很漂亮呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "871b20fd902e369b950f2e3ff98021206151bf967d0d2e1a15b6fa9ab4c539d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc18e432d96d5eb2b499323a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，穿起来真舒服…♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f6294c88f88c299aba896303edce33f449a166bbb44e7313deb0c1e62b63a03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff1cb51f41ff3603fc71eee1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着改变了，心情也会不同呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd80642689c9190857edcdb8d4f84d36a6b7a69b82cdc0dc02a6f0c507724127",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:737fcf570ab58813bf4ef014",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d132b23d4930aa230afc3fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早晨醒来后，首先要做\n舒缓的拉伸。身体循环调整好后，\n连心都会变得轻盈起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "314d7086ca09462ec5888b473da097efb71da73bfe157655f49803a0bf0a24c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4c931824edb7f707389429c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上学途中，有一对麻雀夫妇\n从树枝上向我搭话。它们说，今天的\n风很舒服呢…呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "041aa33076f62ee46ff4759b0d2efffa46f4336ba39e489ca738b5be1f2a94cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbf71803f7e2f5f20f735122",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在食堂里，我和坐在旁边座位的\n孩子聊了起来…那是一段愉快到\n差点忘了吃饭的时光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5cc909e613804dd4612cf8fc85ba301544650fee40784ecfa3165bfa7f99a26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de5a329985cbf8a63d141418",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在想要不要邀请玫瑰同学\n去吃烤肉卷摊。味道稍微浓郁些，\n但我想她会觉得很新鲜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a058cf992d7e9b93c90813869ff5779fdeb6a8e712c53e1153e5c6cb5ede8118",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80802bc404ab8ea78ae9469e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到大家解出难题时的\n笑容，我就很开心。\n今天也要一起开学习会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85fc332995cb96fc6725e3377503c729a78d3c001b0f55283c45b3bd8d63bfec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b03624c40eaf3299160e45f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "睡前，我会翻开最喜欢的画集。\n看着美丽的画作，心也仿佛\n静静地安宁下来…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8af1b8cca320b6e3676d60e805203549caf278f099a61c4698a20bd0a6bac2f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8faf10de60ca964a21c39ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很多孩子会对新环境感到困惑…\n所以我会主动和她们说话，聊聊花。\n希望她们能稍微抬起头向前走。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1413332c5d99bd15fa0b6576a7818f39d95b2a82176a4c8be14d4c5e61fbcb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66244f11a914890f09e4ba90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蛇形烟花，真是不可思议呢…。\n黑色的弯曲痕迹像要形成圆环，\n却又没有形成…莫名让人印象深刻…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "feb0c779213bd132661c01daa4dfae1c53136857429b456d97da9df46d26217e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08a6f25b96616f918510ec20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "前阵子，万籁争鸣同学\n邀请我去听音乐会…呵呵。好像是\n为了感谢我介绍推荐的画展。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d278a3515d3bb4407ac4cae87aff23917d938a2f22ea7107f2b7c0ffa4972c72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea2cfc3756d9908da1732ed0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天时，我们一家人常常围着\n壁炉的火。被同一团火焰温暖着，\n感觉心也会变得温暖…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d513b58103795fa414ddb0df5c7380b06e662d685daf55cc8310864f8faef3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7073ce637bb7c12d1166679b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84545e9d062a703e60cf0240a4c6690b3f86c69931c0b8d072086c92aed0b29d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a805bc79bcec1e4b237a263b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万籁争鸣同学的音乐，总是让我的心\n雀跃不已。昨晚我们也一边护理尾巴，\n一边一起哼着歌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e56dd1a47c9542c8755b0391260e5a25f1116b00c0fc9384e597e4a05cd5268d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31fd41dd1f23fbf2a679efce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到没有插上的插头，\n我总会忍不住在意。\n总觉得它看起来有些寂寞…",
      "source_fingerprint": "860e2b3d3c22b293770373f404a8318de2f80dd7d2a71d1f96a4ced89ad67e0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82efb5ac05e886c71d2a8602",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我经常和在法国留学的朋友\n视频通话。每次都聊得很开心，\n让人感觉不到距离呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21bcc23049ef2daa9fc67ad48178f5d3cbe96f61a178ad028fc7954cc401b4d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6073aba693c9b835849ed1fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在宝石之中，绿松石尤其会\n夺走我的心。那鲜明的水蓝色，\n总会让我不由得看入迷…",
      "source_fingerprint": "5964a51af13f077e4a06dc1b7f55a608987f436dfad3db30ecb5f424dffc6bcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35cd72713c2cc53db357e5cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "袜子我总是会先用夹子夹住\n再收起来。要是只剩下一只，\n就太可怜了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ce15feaeaa3fae4f04ee9e608f344766e90a7921d2230d46ab6dd6752710db7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:594f2e96b88bd78d5e49a5c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "舞蹈课程非常开心。\n大家配合动作时，\n感觉连心也合而为一了…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee9f34b662ff810cfa9aa0fd02f3eecf26a59a33df8812387803bea24c82cb57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb07d5ba88516e8ea7416c89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想用歌声和舞蹈传达。\n愿无论何时，大家都能拥有\n想起笑容的瞬间——",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a0ad9fc8fef5e6d38eb73d84754bcb5362c711b71c1e47039a2231bb6aa949e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7574aec7d9850795a704a943",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我向这身衣装的纯白——起誓。\n我会继续前行，送去洁白闪耀的希望，\n让自己能陪伴每一个人的心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9430eaf49abe2769cd015a10d49d2061b8e521a347924235fa24dc4aadeaea37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91007"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
